{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31479","headline":"送处士自番禺东游便归苏台别业 · 李羣玉","name":"送处士自番禺东游便归苏台别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哑轧暮江上，橹声摇落心。\n宛陵三千里，路指吴云深。\n蓴菜动归兴，忽然闻会吟。\n南浮龙川月，东下敬亭岑。\n多君咏逍遥，结萝碧溪阴。\n高笼华表鹤，静对幽兰琴。\n汗漫江海思，傲然抽冠簪。\n归屿未云寂，还家应追寻。\n二陆文苑秀，迢嶤怀所钦。\n惜我入洛晚，不睹双南金。\n江左风流尽，名贤成古今。\n送君无限意，别酒但加斟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}